{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"461","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Appleman and Complicated Task"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Toastman came up with a very complicated task. He gives it to Appleman, but Appleman doesn't know how to solve it. Can you help him?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Given a "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n × n"},{"kind":"text","text":" checkerboard. Each cell of the board has either character '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', or character '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"o"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', or nothing. How many ways to fill all the empty cells with '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"o"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (each cell must contain only one character in the end) are there, such that for each cell the number of adjacent cells with '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"o"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' will be even? Find the number of ways modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1000000007"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(109 + 7)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Two cells of the board are adjacent if they share a side."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, k ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the size of the board, and the number of cells that has characters initially. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines follows. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line contains two integers and a character: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai, bi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" is either '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"o"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'). This line means: there is a character "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the cell that is located on the intersection of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th row and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th column. All the given cells are distinct."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider that the rows are numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" from top to bottom. Analogically, the columns are numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" from left to right."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the answer to the problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2\n1 1 x\n2 2 o\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3\n2 4 x\n3 4 x\n3 2 x\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example there are two ways:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n    xxo          xoo\n    xox          ooo\n    oxx          oox\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"461D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/461/problem/D"}